<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Sets the creator of the specified event.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>Overriding the creator object on existing events can have adverse effects.
